      "name": "auto-prune-empty-sessions",
      "prompt": "Safest cleanup of Hermes empty sessions. Work in F:\\CD\\Hermes Agent. Steps: 1. Run hermes sessions prune --max-messages 0 --dry-run and show the list. 2. Only if every listed session has 0 msgs and no title, run hermes sessions prune --max-messages 0 --yes to delete them. 3. Never delete sessions with 1 or more messages, never use --include-pinned or --include-archived, never use --force, never touch config or state.db directly. 4. Then run hermes sessions stats and report how many empties were removed and that the real chats are untouched.",
